Having been satisfied with the cup of [[Tea]] from [[Celadon Condominiums|Celadon Mansion]], the guards will now let you enter [[Saffron City]] directly from any adjacent city. Saffron City is a sprawling metropolis located in the heart of the region between [[Cerulean City]], [[Celadon City]], [[Lavender Town]], and [[Vermilion City]]. The [[Silph Co.]] headquarters dominates the city skyline, and two Pokémon Gyms stand in the northeast district. It is the most populous city in all of [[Kanto]].

