===Mr. Psychic's house===
The southeast house belongs to a man known as Mr. Psychic. Speak to him and he claims to know exactly why you are here, and gives you {{TM|29|Psychic}}.

===Silph Co.===
The [[Silph Co]]. is the leading manufacturer of items like Poké Balls, Potions, and TMs. Their products are supplied to every Poké Mart in the region. The company has been a target of [[Team Rocket]], first for their [[Silph Scope]] prototype, and now for a top-secret development project. The Rocket Grunt posted outside the building has fallen asleep, leaving a perfect opportunity to sneak inside. The building holds eleven floors, with [[warp panel]]s allowing the workers to quickly move around. This convenience ends up acting as a maze for anyone trying to reach the top floor.

