===Saffron Gym===
[[File:Saffron Gym FRLG.png|thumb|Saffron Gym]]

{{sign|FRLG|header}}
{{sign|FRLG|title|SAFFRON CITY POKéMON GYM<br>LEADER: SABRINA}}
{{sign|FRLG|The Master of Psychic Pokémon!}}
{{sign|FRLG|footer}}

The [[Saffron Gym]] specializes in {{t|Psychic}} Pokémon. Psychic-type moves are super effective against {{t|Fighting}}- and {{type|Poison}} Pokémon, while Psychic-type Pokémon are weak to {{t|Bug}}-, {{t|Dark}}-, and {{type|Ghost}} moves.

The Gym uses [[Saffron Gym#Generations I-IV|a series of warp panels]] to confuse and disorient any challengers. Step on the panel near the entrance to reach the southeast room. To reach the Gym Leader by using as few warps as possible, continue by stepping on the northwest, southwest, and southwest panels in the following rooms. This leads to the center room, where [[Sabrina]] awaits anyone up to the challenge.

