After the battle, [[Sabrina]] awards you the {{badge|Marsh}}, which ensures obedience from all Pokémon up to level 70 and enables the use of {{m|Rock Smash}} in the field. She also gives you {{TM|04|Calm Mind}} as a prize.

The next destination is [[Fuchsia City]] to the south. There are two paths that lead there: either take Cycling Road west of [[Celadon City]], or follow the coast south of [[Lavender Town]].


